    <UKStatementofReasons>
OJSC StankoGomel is an 
“involved person” under the Republic of Belarus (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulation 2019 because OJSC StankoGomel is and has been involved in conduct destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine, including by supporting or facilitating Russia’s actions in respect of Ukraine, in particular as OJSC StankoGomel manufactures machine tools which are exported to Russia for use in the Russian military industrial sector.
</UKStatementofReasons>
